{
  "_readme": [
    "台灣端資料投遞清單。台灣主機的抓取腳本每輪先取這份最新版，照 jobs 逐項抓，",
    "把原始 bytes（不解析）＋.sha256 送回本站主機的 inbox。完整交接說明見 docs/taiwan-host-handoff.md。",
    "本檔刻意放 public repo：內容只有政府公開資料的網址，無任何機密。",
    "取得方式：curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/weiqi-kids/folk.tw/main/docs/intake-manifest.json",
    "維護者＝境外主機（folk.tw 專案）。台灣端不要改這份檔——改了下輪會被覆蓋。",
    "偵察類任務（慶典查詢等尚不知網址者）不在此清單，寫在 taiwan-host-handoff.md 的散文指示裡。"
  ],
  "version": 8,
  "updated": "2026-08-06",
  "politeness": {
    "min_interval_ms": 1000,
    "user_agent": "folk.tw-intake/1.0 (+https://folk.tw; contact via site)",
    "max_requests_per_run": 200,
    "backoff": "指數退避：失敗第 n 次等 2^n 秒（上限 300 秒）；連續 5 次失敗就記 state.json 收工，下輪再來"
  },
  "jobs": [
    {
      "id": "religion-foundation-list",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/Religion/FoundationTemple?ci=1",
      "dest": "recon-service/foundation-list.html",
      "max_age_days": 90,
      "note": "宗教團體查詢結果全量（PageSize=100）。目的只有一個：收 UploadFileID。",
      "paginate": {
        "method": "POST",
        "page_param": "Page",
        "start": 1,
        "max_pages": 200,
        "form": {
          "Name": "", "NameAdv": "", "UniformNum": "",
          "ReligionType": "", "Country": "", "Area": "", "God": "",
          "RegisterType": "", "IsProperty": "",
          "RT": "true", "RL": "true", "RLT": "true", "RLC": "true", "RLF": "true",
          "RN": "true", "RNT": "true", "RNC": "true", "RNF": "true", "RG": "true",
          "Property_1": "false", "Property_2": "false", "Property_3": "false",
          "Page": "1", "Searched": "yes", "PageSize": "100"
        },
        "dest_template": "recon-service/foundation-list/page-{page}.html",
        "total_pages_re": "共 (\\d+) 頁",
        "stop_when_missing": "<tr",
        "expect_per_page": {
          "http_status": 200,
          "min_bytes": 150000,
          "contains": "<tr"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 150000,
        "contains": "<tr"
      },
      "_why": [
        "**這個 job 的產物不會直接上站**，它只是為了取得 `UploadFileID`——",
        "沿革／建築特色／參拜流程的內容都在 `GetUploadFile?UploadFileID=N&IndexID=2|3|4`，",
        "而那些 id **不在 temple.xml（8203）裡**（2026-08-06 實查，該檔只有編號/名稱/地址/主祀/教別/",
        "登記別/電話/負責人/座標），唯一列出它們的地方就是這個查詢結果頁的",
        "`<a class='other' main='<UploadFileID>' idx='<IndexID>'>`。",
        "收完之後由境外端產出 url_list 清單檔，才輪到真正的內容 job。",
        "2026-08-06 實測 PageSize=100 的單頁約 600 KB、PageSize=20 約 300 KB",
        "（頁面固定開銷就 ~230 KB），故 min_bytes 設 150000＝連末頁也過得了、又擋得住錯誤頁。",
        "🔴 form 用的是**單值版**：checkbox 的 true/false 重複鍵 JSON 表達不出來，",
        "台灣端 2026-08-05 已實測兩版等價（見 inbox/recon-service/FOUNDATION-FORM-PAYLOAD.md）。",
        "🔴 抓回來的列含**電話與負責人＝個資**，只留在 inbox（repo 外）；",
        "境外端產出的清單檔只准有 key 與 url 兩欄，不得帶任何個資進 public repo。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "temple-xml",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/Report/temple.xml",
      "dest": "temple-xml/temple.xml",
      "max_age_days": 35,
      "note": "內政部全國宗教資訊系統・寺廟（data.gov.tw dataset 8203），約每月更新。境外 IP 擋。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 4000000,
        "contains": "<OpenData_3>",
        "not_smaller_than_current_pct": 90,
        "min_occurrences": {
          "<OpenData_3>": 12000
        },
        "_why": [
          "min_bytes 這種絕對下限擋不住殘檔：2026-07-30 實測投一個 5MB 截斷檔（真檔 6.27MB）",
          "通過了 4MB 下限、也含 <OpenData_3>，直接覆蓋掉完整檔（12,419 筆只剩前 5MB）。",
          "故必須有相對檢查：not_smaller_than_current_pct（不得比現有檔小超過 10%）",
          "與 min_occurrences（整檔記錄筆數下限）。現況 12,419 筆，下限設 12,000 容許少量退場。"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "religion-robots",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/robots.txt",
      "dest": "misc/religion-robots.txt",
      "max_age_days": 90,
      "note": "抓取前的禮貌檢查：確認慶典查詢路徑未被 robots 禁止。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status_any_of": [
          200,
          404
        ],
        "record_status_only": true,
        "_why": [
          "台灣端 2026-07-30 回報此網址實回 404，而原本寫 http_status:200 會讓這個 job 永遠失敗（我的錯）。",
          "robots.txt 回 404 本身就是有效答案＝該站未宣告任何抓取限制，不是錯誤。",
          "故本 job 只記錄狀態、不以 HTTP 碼判成敗；404 時把回應內容（可能為空或錯誤頁）照樣送回即可，",
          "由境外端判讀。若哪天變成 200 且含 Disallow，抓取範圍就要跟著改。"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "religion-festival-entry",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/Festival/Festival?ci=1",
      "dest": "religion-festival/festival-entry.html",
      "max_age_days": 30,
      "note": "慶(祭)典查詢入口頁。空條件單次 GET 即渲染全部資料列，含 ODS 沒有的「電話」「宗教別」。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 5000000,
        "contains": "<tr",
        "min_occurrences": {
          "<tr": 6000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "religion-festival-ods",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/Festival/FestivalOdsReport.ods",
      "dest": "religion-festival/festival-export.ods",
      "max_age_days": 30,
      "method": "POST",
      "form": {
        "FestivalName": "",
        "ReligionName": "",
        "ReligionType": "",
        "Area": "",
        "Country": "",
        "FestivalType": "",
        "Lunar": "",
        "Month_Start": "",
        "Day_Start": "",
        "Month_End": "",
        "Day_End": "",
        "FestivalDate_Start": "",
        "FestivalDate_End": "",
        "Week": ""
      },
      "token": {
        "field": "__RequestVerificationToken",
        "from_job": "religion-festival-entry"
      },
      "note": "官方 ODS 批次匯出，條件全空＝全量 6,634 筆。必須排在 entry 之後。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 200000,
        "contains": "mimetype"
      },
      "_why": [
        "ODS 的 sha256 每輪都會變（.ods 是 zip、壓縮時間戳每次不同）——**這不代表資料變了**，要比對內容請解壓後再比。",
        "曆別（農曆/國曆）只有 HTML 有、ODS 沒有，所以 entry 那份是主來源、本份是對帳用。見 docs/festival-data-import.md。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "crgis-folk-customs",
      "url": "https://crgis.rchss.sinica.edu.tw/resources/internet/folk_customs/list",
      "dest": "crgis/folk-customs-list.html",
      "max_age_days": 7,
      "_alert": false,
      "_alert_note": "已知來源停擺（中研院站台自 2026-07-30 起 HTTP 000）；2026-08-03 起靜音，復站收到檔後把此欄拿掉。",
      "note": "中研院 CRGIS。2026-07-30 起連續不通（TCP 443 逾時，母站亦同）。加成 job 讓它每輪自動重試。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 1000
      },
      "_why": [
        "**預期會一直失敗，這不是設定錯誤**：台灣端 2026-07-30 起連測三天皆 HTTP 000，連母站 rchss.sinica.edu.tw 也不通。",
        "是連不上、不是沒有資料——**不要據此判定該來源無效並刪掉這個 job**。",
        "`_alert: false`＝新鮮度提醒對這個 job 靜音（台灣端仍每輪重試，收到就會上位）。2026-08-03 加：",
        "刻意用底線開頭——這是**境外端專用**欄位，台灣端遇到不認得的欄位會停擺，而底線欄位一律忽略。",
        "它每天都在發 Slack「台灣主機的抓取腳本可能沒在跑」，而 state.json 同時證明台灣端有在跑＝指控錯的一方。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-zaoshen",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/Knowledge/Content?ci=2&cid=265",
      "dest": "misc/knowledge-zaoshen-cid265.html",
      "max_age_days": 90,
      "note": "灶神條目頁，iconography 用。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 30000,
        "contains": "</html>"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-deity-entries",
      "url_list": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/weiqi-kids/folk.tw/main/docs/intake-urls-knowledge.json",
      "dest_dir": "knowledge-deities/",
      "dest_template": "{key}.html",
      "max_age_days": 180,
      "note": "宗教知識+／宗教神祇 96 個條目全文（iconography 來源）。清單由 scripts/gen-intake-urls-knowledge.mjs 產生。",
      "expect_per_item": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 30000,
        "contains": "</html>"
      },
      "_why": [
        "🔴 **這是第一個用 `url_list` 的 job**。台灣端 2026-08-05 已實作並自測 67/67，",
        "依 handoff §3.5 的欄位契約，收到「已實作並自測」後境外端才可以放進 manifest——條件已滿足。",
        "為什麼不用列表頁就好：`Knowledge/List?ci=2&cid=3` 只有**截斷摘要**（每則結尾是「…」），",
        "iconography 要的敘述在條目全文裡，只能逐條抓。",
        "授權：2026-08-06 內政部同意使用，條件為**標示資料來源連結**——",
        "所以每一筆匯入都必須掛回它自己的 `Knowledge/Content?ci=2&cid=<N>` 網址。",
        "⚠️ `url_list` 不可與 `url`／`dest`／`paginate` 併用，併用會被擋下不抓（URLLIST-SPEC）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-deities-list",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/Knowledge/List?ci=2&cid=3",
      "dest": "misc/knowledge-deities-list-cid3.html",
      "max_age_days": 90,
      "note": "神祇分類列表，96 個條目，iconography 可由此擴充。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 50000,
        "contains": "</html>"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "local-celebration",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/LocalCelebration/Index?ci=96",
      "dest": "misc/local-celebration-ci96.html",
      "max_age_days": 90,
      "note": "地方宗教慶典（第 1 頁）。列表共 6 頁，其餘見下方 -p2..-p6。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 30000,
        "contains": "</html>"
      },
      "_why": [
        "2026-08-06 台灣端實測：分頁**用 GET 就能翻**（`&page=N`），不必 POST——",
        "頁面 JS 雖然寫 `SubmitForm.method = \"post\"`，但伺服器同時吃 query string。",
        "驗證方式：第 1 頁必含「神明淨港」，page=2 起不含；六頁 cid 去重後為 65，與頁面自報一致。",
        "所以第 2–6 頁改成一般 job，這條線不再需要人工開工單。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "local-celebration-p2",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/LocalCelebration/Index?ci=96&page=2",
      "dest": "misc/local-celebration-ci96-p2.html",
      "max_age_days": 90,
      "note": "地方宗教慶典 第 2 頁。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 30000,
        "contains": "</html>"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "local-celebration-p3",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/LocalCelebration/Index?ci=96&page=3",
      "dest": "misc/local-celebration-ci96-p3.html",
      "max_age_days": 90,
      "note": "地方宗教慶典 第 3 頁。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 30000,
        "contains": "</html>"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "local-celebration-p4",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/LocalCelebration/Index?ci=96&page=4",
      "dest": "misc/local-celebration-ci96-p4.html",
      "max_age_days": 90,
      "note": "地方宗教慶典 第 4 頁。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 30000,
        "contains": "</html>"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "local-celebration-p5",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/LocalCelebration/Index?ci=96&page=5",
      "dest": "misc/local-celebration-ci96-p5.html",
      "max_age_days": 90,
      "note": "地方宗教慶典 第 5 頁。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 30000,
        "contains": "</html>"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "local-celebration-p6",
      "url": "https://religion.moi.gov.tw/LocalCelebration/Index?ci=96&page=6",
      "dest": "misc/local-celebration-ci96-p6.html",
      "max_age_days": 90,
      "note": "地方宗教慶典 最後一頁（筆數本來就比前幾頁少，min_bytes 故意設低）。",
      "expect": {
        "http_status": 200,
        "min_bytes": 25000,
        "contains": "</html>"
      }
    }
  ]
